    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2.4rem,7vw,4.7rem);line-height:1.05">Why give this away?</h1>
    <p class="rg-lede">Building and using 12 Week Recomp changed how I understand my own training, nutrition and health. I wanted a way to see what my body was doing, learn from the results, and make better choices each day.</p>
    <p class="rg-lede">I believe more people deserve access to that kind of practical understanding. You should be able to learn how strength, food and recovery work together without a sales pitch or a credit card. That is why the system is free to use.</p>
    <p class="rg-lede">It is a learning tool, not a promise of particular results or a substitute for your clinician's advice. Use it, ask questions, and make it your own. If it helps you understand your body a little better, sharing it was the right thing to do.</p>
